# EnergyModels — local/runtime artifacts. Third-party weights are never committed
# (the wrist-CNN upstream ships no licence); derived artifacts are fetched or built.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
*.part
artifacts/**
!artifacts/**/
!artifacts/**/manifest.json
!artifacts/**/NOTICE.md
# Test fixtures are synthetic or public-dataset excerpts (see artifacts/*/NOTICE.md); the repo-wide
# `Fixtures/` rule (personal exports) also matches this directory on a case-insensitive filesystem.
!tests/fixtures/
